      "text": "Ties carry no direction and drop out. Unpaired on 50 tasks near 50%, the 95% interval on the difference is about 20 points either way: pair by construction.",
      "originalText": "Ties carry no direction and drop out. Unpaired on 50 tasks near 50%, the 95% interval on the difference is about 20 points either way: pair by construction.",
